   273	
   274	### PNG
   275	
   276	`renderMermaidPNG` renders offline with `@resvg/resvg-js`. It loads:
   277	
   278	1. The bundled Inter faces used by the text-metrics model.
   279	2. DejaVu Sans as a per-glyph fallback for symbols Inter lacks.
   280	3. The bundled faces referenced by built-in Styles: Caveat, EB Garamond,
   281	   Architects Daughter, and Share Tech Mono.
   282	4. Any directories supplied through `fontDirs`.
   283	5. OS-installed fonts only when `loadSystemFonts: true` is requested.
   284	
   285	The CLI equivalents are `--font-dirs <dir[,dir...]>` and `--system-fonts`.
   286	Prefer a dedicated `fontDirs` directory when reproducible output matters.
   287	System-font loading makes the result depend on the machine's installed faces.
   288	
   289	The family stored inside the font file must match the intended family token in
   290	the Style's `font` value — normally the first family in its stack. Supply the
   291	weights the diagram uses; Agentic Mermaid commonly emits 400, 500, 600, and
   292	700. If an unbundled requested family cannot be resolved, PNG rasterization
   293	uses Inter, with DejaVu available for per-glyph fallback.
   294	
